  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "話題の　絵本作家との　コラボグッズ。優しいタッチで　描かれた　ポケモンが食卓に　花を　添えてくれる　テーブルクロス。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "화제의 그림책 작가와의 콜라보 상품. 따뜻한 그림체로 그려진 포켓몬이 식탁에 활기를 불어넣어 주는 테이블보.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "和當紅的繪本作家合作的商品。桌巾上以溫柔筆觸描繪出的寶可夢能夠為餐桌增添光彩。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe arborant des dessins venant de livres illustrés très populaires. Les Pokémon tracés avec soin donnent à la table une touche délicate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses Tischtuch ist in Kollaboration mit einem beliebten Bilderbuchautor entstanden. Die liebevoll gezeichneten Pokémon verleihen jedem Esstisch eine Portion Charme.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Este mantel, diseñado por un famoso autor de libros ilustrados, trae a tu mesa un montón de adorables Pokémon acompañados de flores.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia creata in collaborazione con una celebrità nel campo dei libri illustrati. I Pokémon disegnati con tocco delicato abbelliscono la tavola.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A tablecloth made in collaboration with a popular picture-book author. The gently drawn Pokémon make even the loveliest picnic table more charming.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "話題の　絵本作家との　コラボグッズ。優しいタッチで　描かれた　ポケモンが食卓に　花を　添えてくれる　テーブルクロス。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "与当红绘本作家共同创作的商品。这款桌巾上有着以温柔笔触描绘出的宝可梦，能为餐桌增花添彩。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
